# What `moon publish` leaves out of the package.
#
# A `.moonignore` overrides the `.gitignore` in the same directory rather than
# adding to it, so the build directories are repeated here.
_build/
.mooncakes/
target/

# The rendered example report. It is generated from `examples/fib.wasm` and is
# 1.2 MB of a 2.4 MB package; it belongs in the repository, where the README
# links to it, but not in a module somebody just `moon add`ed. The example's
# source and binary stay, and so does the chart library, which `--html` falls
# back to for an offline page.
examples/report.html
examples/report.png
